                                                                owl:versionIRI <http://ClimOO/climoo/climoo-piccomela/imports/sumso-imports#26-10-30> ;
                                                                <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """This file contains ClimOO ontology suite imports from the Sustainable Meat Systems Ontology (SuMSO). Imports have been manually collected and revised.

This files contains also imports from the Ontology for Biomedical Investigations (OBI) and Vaccine Ontology (VO) reused in SuMSO  and relevant for ClimOO.

Ontology source: SuMSO V1.0.2.
https://w3id.org/sumso
http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/obi.owl
http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/vo.owl"""@en ;
                                                                rdfs:seeAlso "https://w3id.org/sumso/repo" ;
                                                                owl:versionInfo "2026-10-30" .

