                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "YH" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Company" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000412> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/vo.owl> ;
                                            <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> "material entity" ;
                                            rdfs:comment """SuMSO developer comment:
We envision improving this definition. Diiscussions with subject matter expert are required to revise it."""@en ;
