                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Released> .


###  https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000065
<https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000065> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> ,
                                                       [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>
                                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                owl:onProperty <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000081> ;
                                                                                owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000097>
                                                                              ]
                                                                            ) ;
                                                         rdf:type owl:Class
                                                       ] ;
                                       rdfs:comment "The definition requires revisions, to include, for instance, reference to features such as salary or working rules. Similarly, we consider possible implementation for non-human workers, such as animals. We envision having discussions with subject matter experts to improve it."@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "worker-role"@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role that inheres in a human by virtue of engaging in some supply chain activities."@en ;
                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> .


###  https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000069
<https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000069> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000097>
                                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> ;
                                                                                    owl:someValuesFrom <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/AGRO_00000372>
                                                                                  ]
                                                                                ) ;
                                                             rdf:type owl:Class
                                                           ] ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000097> ;
                                       rdfs:comment "Future implementations may include classes to also represent farmer and rancher companies."@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "farmer"@en ;
                                       rdfs:seeAlso """See also: 
http://snomed.info/id/159812002 
http://snomed.info/id/106388008 
http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OCCO_11901000
http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OCCO_45000000"""@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A human with a farmer role."@en ;
                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Released> .


###  https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000097
<https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000097> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606>
                                                                                  [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                    owl:onProperty <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087> ;
                                                                                    owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000065>
                                                                                  ]
                                                                                ) ;
                                                             rdf:type owl:Class
                                                           ] ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606> ;
                                       rdfs:comment "SuMSO currently limits this term to refer to humans. Future implementations will deal with considering machines as workers, for instance, to substitute humans in participating in supply chain activities."@en ,
                                                    "We started to create classes and axioms for some meat supply chain workers. Additional ones are required to complete this hierarchy. We opted to start with those that the stakeholders of our project suggest as the most relevant."@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "worker (human)"@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A human with a worker role."@en ;
                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> .


###  https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000144
<https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000144> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/sumso#SuMSO_0000063> ,
                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                         owl:onProperty <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000081> ;
                                                         owl:someValuesFrom <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/VO_0000299>
                                                       ] ;
                                       rdfs:comment """We envision improving this definition and those of the subclasses we created to encompass references to legal reasons and values established and generated through the constitution of the company and its exercise.

This class and related subclasses also require axiomatizations to cover references to information content entities related to company commitment. We envision creating new information content entity classes for this scope."""@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "company-role"@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role that is bearered by a company."@en ;
                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> .


